        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI MIAMI, Satin Nickel Miami Knob with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nArriving on the scene is the Miami Knob Modern Edition. This contemporary knobset combines all the most sought after traits of modern door hardware into one easy to install--easy to order knobset. The Miami Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and comes in a gorgeous satin nickel finish. It will fit most pre-drilled doors,\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Explore Hardware Miami Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid metal knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Miami Modern Knobset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.03\" (51.6mm)</li>\r\n<li>Knob Thickness: .075\" (19.1mm)</li>\r\n<li>Knob Stem Diameter: 0.83\" (21mm)</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1.88\" (47.6mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2.36\" (59.9mm) square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 0.39\" (10mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8’’ to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-miami-specifications.pdf?v=1691093348\"><b>AHI Miami Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knob on one side of the door. Visible surface mounting screws. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li></li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Visible surface mounting screws on interior and exterior. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Privacy pin on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
