                "title": "Miami Knob Modern Edition",
                "description": "Arriving on the scene is the Miami Knob Modern Edition. This contemporary knobset combines all the most sought after traits of modern door hardware into one easy to install--easy to order knobset. The Miami Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and comes in a gorgeous satin nickel finish. It will fit most pre-drilled doors,",
